  "summary": "San Jose city leaders are moving to adopt new rules for ALPR camera use after a police officer was fired for misusing Flock data to help a family member in a domestic violence case. Proposed measures include prohibiting non-police device access, strengthening spot audits, and pursuing state legislation on unauthorized access; the Rules and Open Government Committee will consider them Sept. 30.",
